    <string name="trb_trend_info_title">Why a trend?</string>
    <string name="trb_trend_info_text">Your weight swings by 1–2 kg from day to day, mostly water, salt, food and training. The trend smooths those swings out – each reading pulls it only a tenth of the way – so you see what really changes. Gaps are fine; weighing now and then is enough.</string>
