    <string name="trb_ape_index">Ape index</string>
    <string name="trb_ape_info_text">Arm span minus height. A positive value means your arms reach further than you are tall, which helps on long moves. It describes your build, not a training goal. Enter height and arm span once.</string>
    <string name="trb_ape_missing">Enter height and arm span to see your ape index.</string>
    <string name="trb_strength_title">Strength to weight</string>
    <string name="trb_strength_subtitle">Progress through strength, not through the scale.</string>
    <string name="trb_strength_info_text">Shown is the best load per training day as a percentage of your body weight: for hangs body weight plus added weight, for block lifts the lifted weight, for weighted pull-ups the estimated maximum. Each set remembers the body weight of its day.</string>
